		(property "Note" "+12V four-switch buck-boost (S9.0, SLVSGT7): 3-36 V in, average inductor limit 7-9 A, VREF 1.188-1.212 V, 966 kHz (R110 20k), FPWM (MODE = VCC), internal LDO (EXTVCC = VCC), no dithering (DITH = GND), CDC open (no droop compensation), PG/CC open. Regulates 12.08 V from the whole 12.5-16.5 V converter input (buck, buck-boost and boost modes; the S8 TPS62933F buck needed 0.995-1.053 duty at low line against its 98 % maximum). EN/UVLO = MAIN_OK. Its output OVP (22.5-24.5 V) is not a 12 V protection: the U20 guard watches the rail"
