		(property "Note" "S9.2 common input switch, SHDN = RUN. UVLO R2 100k precision / (R3 10k precision + R114 510R): <13.0 V worst-case start. OVP (R28+R4 130k / R24 9.1k) rises at 17.30-19.44 V, recovers at 16.03-18.27 V: opens before D24 (VR 20 V, VBR >= 22.2 V) can conduct. FLT/PGOOD = MAIN_OK. U4 independently requires RUN AND MAIN_LED_OK and derives EN drive from own VPD."
