		(property "Note" "Gate 1: ANY_BAD = NAND(MAIN_LED_OK, P12_OK, N12_OK, V3V3) (S9.0: the +5V input is tied high). Gate 2 (S8.5): START_N = NAND(MAIN_LED_OK, RUN): low once U5 is on with valid status while RUN, presets the STARTED latch (U12 A); RUN in the gate keeps PRE_N high while RESET clears it."
