		(property "Note" "MON_OVN clamp: diode 1 GND -> MON_OVN, diode 2 shorted. With V3V3 gone and -12V held it keeps U20 pin 9 near -0.24 V at 25 C only (0.1 mA VF max); cold it can pass -0.3 V. Not a guaranteed input clamp: R99 limits the node current to <=0.15 mA at -16 V (input rating 50 mA). ~0 V across it at the trip"
