		(property "Note" "Always-on VPD supply (not V3V3), V3V3 pull-up on OV_N. Full-temperature input ceiling VPD-2 V; REF_OV <=1.259 V. Senses +12V and -12V (S9.0: two channels, two spares); severe OV presets FAULT even before ARMED. S8.4: with V3V3 lost but VPD present U20 may stay powered; its outputs then drive dead pull-ups and R64 holds RUN low, so it cannot enable anything (s8_calcs v3v3_loss)."
